OL,3,GNEWSAGuernsey introducing vaping liquid
OL,4,Aexcise duty
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new excise duty on vaping liquids is
OL,7,Fbeing introduced from November in
OL,8,FGuernsey and Alderney.
OL,10,FThe States of Guernsey agreed as part
OL,11,Fof its last budget that a duty rate of
OL,12,F#2.20 per 10ml of vaping liquid should
OL,13,Fbe introduced this year.
OL,15,FThe duty is set to apply to all liquids
OL,16,Fintended to be used in vaping devices,
OL,17,Fwhether they contain nicotine or not
OL,18,Fand whatever type of container or
OL,19,Fdevice used. However, medicinal
OL,20,Fproducts intended to be vaporised will
OL,21,Fbe exempt.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
