OL,3,GNEWSAGuernsey introducing vaping liquid
OL,4,Aexcise duty
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy Charles Parkinson, treasury lead
OL,7,Ffor the Policy & Resources Committee,
OL,8,Fsaid  it brought the products into line
OL,9,Fwith other excise goods, such as
OL,10,Ftobacco and alcohol, and provided a
OL,11,F"consistent approach to their
OL,12,Ftaxation".
